/**
 * The Continua "Africa globe": a dotted silhouette of the African continent
 * (built from real Natural-Earth country geometry, not hand-drawn), warped
 * with a spherical dome projection so it visibly curves like a globe, lit
 * from the upper-left with per-dot size/brightness falloff toward the rim,
 * a soft specular highlight, an edge vignette, and two static, tilted orbit
 * rings — each with a single glowing gold dot that travels one full lap
 * around it before handing off to the other ring.
 *
 * Two variants:
 *  - "compact": for tight, non-marketing spaces (e.g. the Markets overview
 *    card). No breathing pulse, no hover state. Still shows the static
 *    orbit rings and their traveling dot.
 *  - "hero": for the landing page. Adds a gentle breathing pulse and a
 *    hover glow.
 *
 * Both variants default to a theme-matched backdrop (reads the app's own
 * --muted / --background CSS variables), so the globe blends into whatever
 * light, dark, or black-themed surface it's placed on instead of carrying
 * a fixed background of its own.
 *
 * Colors follow the brand gradient (orange north → violet south) per the
 * brand spec, modulated by the sphere shading so the curvature reads even
 * in a static screenshot.
 */
